--[[
    INDIAN RAILWAYS LHB AC THREE TIER SLEEPER
    STATIC REALISTIC EXTERIOR MODEL GENERATOR

    This is a pure Roblox Studio Luau builder.
    It creates a sealed, non-interactive, exterior-only coach model.
    No seats, doors, lights, train control, sounds, or player systems are added.
    Every visible piece is anchored so the result behaves as a display model.

    INSTALLATION
    1. Create a Script inonceside ServerScriptService in Roblox Studio.
    2. Replace its contents with this file.
    3. Press Play  in Studio.
    4. The generated model is placed in Workspace/LHB_AC3_Realistic.
    5. Stop Play, copy the generated model if you want to keep it in Edit mode.

    ORIENTATION
    X = coach length, positive X is the A-end.
    Y = vertical, the rail head is approximately Y = 0.
    Z = coach width, positive Z is the right side when looking toward A-end.

    SCALE
    1 Roblox stud = 0.30 real-world metres.
    Main dimensions are based on a generic Indian Railways LHB passenger coach:
    body length approximately 23.5 m, body width approximately 3.25 m,
    and roof height approximately 4.15 m above the rail head.

    ACCURACY NOTE
    LHB coach batches differ in window spacing, equipment, livery and numbering.
    This generator uses a production-style AC 3-tier exterior arrangement.
    It is deliberately model-only and does not claim to reproduce an individual
    railway vehicle's inspection drawing or a particular coach's serial number.
]]

